1
00:00:00,479 --> 00:00:01,899
[DOOR CLOSES]

2
00:00:12,992 --> 00:00:14,992
[DIALING]

3
00:00:17,955 --> 00:00:19,745
Hi, Leonard?

4
00:00:22,627 --> 00:00:24,207
(Sheldon:)It's me.

5
00:00:24,378 --> 00:00:26,048
(Penny:)Sheldon.

6
00:00:27,173 --> 00:00:28,883
(Sheldon:)In the living room.

7
00:00:29,050 --> 00:00:31,470
(Sheldon:)I just...
I wanted you to know I saw the tie.

8
00:00:31,636 --> 00:00:34,266
(Sheldon:)Message received.

9
00:00:36,974 --> 00:00:39,014
(Lesley:)You're welcome.

10
00:00:39,977 --> 00:01:20,037
You carry on. Give my best to Leslie.

